doc:district_court_additional_costs_2001_10_11_finally_concluded a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "Lastly, on 11 October 2001 the Slovenj Gradec District Court ordered the applicant to pay an additional sum to cover the costs of one of the witnesses heard during the proceedings; on that day, the proceedings were “finally concluded”."@en ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:maribor_higher_court_upheld_conviction_amended_costs_2001_05_09 ;
    echr:hasSourceParagraph "50"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "Lastly, on 11 October 2001 the Slovenj Gradec District Court ordered the applicant to pay an additional sum to cover the costs of one of the witnesses heard during the proceedings. On that day, the proceedings were “finally concluded” ( pravnomočno končan postopek )."^^xsd:string .

doc:domestic_proceeding_1 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "criminal proceedings"@en ;
    echr:hasSourceParagraph "3"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "criminal proceedings"@en .

ns1:domestic_proceeding_27 a ns1:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "medical aid sought next day at Maribor General Hospital and x-ray findings (paragraph 27)"^^xsd:string ;
    ns1:followsProceeding ns1:domestic_proceeding_26 ;
    ns1:hasSourceParagraph 27 ;
    ns1:hasSupportingQuote """Next day, 7 April 1995, the applicant sought medical aid in the Maribor General Hospital. There, he also explained to a doctor that on 5 April 1995 he had been beaten by unknown armed persons. The medical report of 7 April 1995 indicates several lesions, including:
- bruises on the right eye and a small amount of suffusion in the surrounding area;
- a haematoma on the left side of the forehead
- a painful nose;
- a 6 cm by 4 cm haematoma on the left shoulder;
- two 4-5 cm linear skin abrasions on the left side of the thorax;
- a child’s-hand-sized moderate oedema behind the right ear;
- an extensive haematoma on the left thigh.
The doctors had also suspected a fracture of the right temporal bone. The report of an x-ray examination on 19 April 1995 indicated that there was a hairline fracture ( fissur a)."""^^xsd:string .

doc:acquittal_judgment_1999_11_22 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "By a judgment of 22 November 1999 the court acquitted the applicant."@en ;
    echr:followsProceeding doc:hearings_first_trial_1999_09_13_and_1999_11_22 ;
    echr:hasSourceParagraph "46"^^xsd:string ;
    echr:hasSupportingQuote "By a judgment of 22 November 1999 the court acquitted the applicant."^^xsd:string .

doc:appeal_public_prosecutor_1997_05_12 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
