doc:conclusion_exclusion_documents_1998_03_17 a echr:DomesticProceeding ;
    rdfs:label "On 17 March 1998 the criminal investigation was concluded with the investigating judge’s decision ordering the exclusion of certain documents from the case-file."@en ;
